# 2️⃣3️⃣ Ethernet Frame

A simplified Ethernet frame contains:

```text id="8r7z4h"
+----------+----------+--------+------+-----+
| Preamble | Addresses| Type   | Data | FCS |
+----------+----------+--------+------+-----+
```

Important fields include:

* Destination MAC
* Source MAC
* Type/Length
* Payload
* FCS

FCS:

**Frame Check Sequence**

Used for error detection.

