# 2️⃣5️⃣ Unicast / Multicast / Broadcast

### Unicast

One sender → one receiver.

```text id="zv0ybb"
A → B
```

### Multicast

One sender → selected group.

```text id="8r2v7m"
A → B,C,D
```

### Broadcast

One sender → all devices in the broadcast domain.

```text id="qg0r8v"
A → Everyone
```

